<?xml version='1.0' encoding='UTF-8'?>
<template xmlns="http://schemas.openehr.org/v1" xmlns:xsi="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema-instance">
  <language>
    <terminology_id>
      <value>ISO_639-1</value>
    </terminology_id>
    <code_string>en</code_string>
  </language>
  <description>
    <original_author id="name">Erik Sundvall / RCC Genomik (draft)</original_author>
    <original_author id="organisation">Regionala cancercentrum i samverkan</original_author>
    <original_author id="date">2026-10-15</original_author>
    <lifecycle_state>unmanaged</lifecycle_state>
    <other_details id="Generated By">Ehrtslib ADL2 template → OPT 1.4 exporter</other_details>
    <details>
      <language>
        <terminology_id>
          <value>ISO_639-1</value>
        </terminology_id>
        <code_string>en</code_string>
      </language>
      <purpose>Swedish RCC cancer genomics result report (Konfigurationsunderlag genomik / T1 Genomikrapport). Event Assessment composition: report-result wrapping laboratory_test_result with specimen (+ anatomical_location, specimen_processing), receiving organisation, sequencing_assay (+ device), genomic_variant_result-cancer (+ CNV-cancer, clinical implication, presence, translocation, substitution), and TMB/MSI/HRD/tumour-cellularity analytes. Request linkage via protocol Test request details / Requester order identifier.</purpose>
      <keywords>genomics</keywords>
      <keywords>cancer</keywords>
      <keywords>report</keywords>
      <keywords>RCC</keywords>
      <keywords>molecular pathology</keywords>
      <keywords>TMB</keywords>
      <keywords>MSI</keywords>
      <keywords>HRD</keywords>
      <use>Fill slots per inventory. Genomic findings and sequencing_assay follow CKM Molecular Pathology Report placement (Test result / Testing details) even where current laboratory_test_result.v1.2.8 slot regexes list only analyte|panel and device — see docs/template-oet-gaps.md. Value sets from valuesets/ are bound in the overlays (specimen type, collection method, fixation, study type/method).</use>
      <copyright>© Regionala cancercentrum i samverkan</copyright>
    </details>
    <details>
      <language>
        <terminology_id>
          <value>ISO_639-1</value>
        </terminology_id>
        <code_string>sv</code_string>
      </language>
      <purpose>Svensk RCC cancergenomikrapport (Konfigurationsunderlag genomik / T1 Genomikrapport). Event Assessment: report-result med laboratorieresultat, prov, organisation, sekvenseringsassay, cancer-varianter och TMB/MSI/HRD.</purpose>
      <keywords>genomik</keywords>
      <keywords>cancer</keywords>
      <keywords>rapport</keywords>
      <keywords>RCC</keywords>
      <keywords>TMB</keywords>
      <keywords>MSI</keywords>
      <keywords>HRD</keywords>
      <use>Fyll slotar enligt inventering. Se docs/template-oet-gaps.md för slot-/OET-luckor. Värdemängder från valuesets/ är bundna i overlays.</use>
      <copyright>© Regionala cancercentrum i samverkan</copyright>
    </details>
  </description>
